### Local app state (runtime DBs, not config) ###
banks/

### Private keyboard/mouse macros (bind personal app paths) ###
local/.local/share/keyboards-mouse/Elecom/

### Merge backups ###
*.orig

### Empryo ###
# Repo-local .empryo/ (project agents, genome, sessions) stays ignored.
# Anchored so it does not also hide dots/.empryo.
/.empryo
# Global config tracked under dots/.empryo; runtime state stays in ~/.empryo.
dots/.empryo/*
!dots/.empryo/config.json
# EMPRYO.md is published by `gap sync` into ~/.empryo, not owned here.
!dots/.empryo/tui-layout.json
!dots/.empryo/orchestrations/
!dots/.empryo/.empryo/
dots/.empryo/.empryo/*
!dots/.empryo/.empryo/memory-config.json

### no-mistakes (config only; runtime state stays in ~/.no-mistakes) ###
dots/.no-mistakes/*
!dots/.no-mistakes/config.yaml

### tool-managed git clones (installed by herdr / gh, not vendored) ###
config/.config/herdr/plugins/github/

### herdr runtime state (rewritten every run; live copies stay in ~/.config/herdr) ###
config/.config/herdr/.plugins.lock
config/.config/herdr/herdr.sock.agent
config/.config/herdr/release-notes.json
config/.config/herdr/session-history.json
config/.config/herdr/session.json
config/.config/herdr/session-snapshots/
config/.config/herdr/plugins/config/
local/.local/share/gh/extensions/gh-markdown-preview/

### Raycast runtime state (extensions + node compile cache are generated) ###
config/.config/raycast/extensions/
config/.config/raycast/node-compile-cache/

### Stale untracked copy left over from the neovim -> neoed rename (real config is in neovim/) ###
neoed/

### WorkBuddy local workspace data (not part of dotfiles) ###
.workbuddy/

